# The output root is generated, but for the lockfiles of its Bun and Cargo
# workspaces, which pin what the site's build installs (D51) and every
# crate the binary builds from (D57). A broader rule may ignore the
# directory itself, which would hide every file under it, so it is taken
# back and its contents ignored instead.
!/dist/
/dist/*
!/dist/bun.lock
!/dist/Cargo.lock
